# Independent verification gate

- Follow the independent testing gate in root `AGENTS.md`.
- Delegate relevant existing checks to `.cursor/agents/orai-test-runner.md` before
  handing off implemented changes, and wait for the result.
- Fix failures, then request an independent rerun before claiming completion.
- Coordinate `.next` ownership; never overlap build/dev/type generation.
- Report passed, failed and not-verified items separately, including warnings.
- Tests do not authorize hosted database mutations or deployment.
